<section class="hql-band hql-band--cta" markdown>

## Run the server programs { .hql-section }

The Kafka, PostgreSQL, NATS and lakehouse programs run in the
[hql-demo repository](https://github.com/ewiger/hql-demo). Each case starts
its servers with Docker Compose and compares the output with the expected
one.

```sh
git clone https://github.com/ewiger/hql-demo && cd hql-demo
./run-all.sh
```

</section>
